      "id": 4,
      "title": "False Positive Tracking & Offline Evaluations",
      "type": "text",
      "options": {
        "content": "### False Positive Tracking\n\nTo track false positives:\n1. Use **Grafana Annotations** (Ctrl/Cmd + click on any time-series point) to manually document reported false positives directly on these graphs.\n2. Cross-reference with offline datasets under `data/eval/safety/` to run automatic adversarial evaluations and compute false positive/negative rates.\n\nRun offline evaluations via target:\n```bash\nmake test  # runs validation test suites\n```",
        "mode": "markdown"
      }
    }
